{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分段落的感受词明显堆叠，尤其S04、S09、S14，个别意象过密或跳跃，反而削弱了精确感；X的连续叙述更自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用短句、关键词放大和感受词分时出现，能让观众在听音乐时迅速抓住情绪转折，不必读完大段文字才能理解重点；感受也有更多身体、呼吸、声音和时间层面的细节。X胜在因果解释和叙事连贯性，读起来更像完整的心理故事，但较长的句子不利于听音乐时快速扫读。整体我选Y，因为它更好地兼顾了即时理解、情绪定位和音乐同步，不过需要适当删减重复的感受意象。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa18251b-9b16-4cf5-b054-5e110be02a67", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194848091213Z", "elapsed_seconds": 117.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:50:45.202914+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8e69d1dc632d05d6e6941ad579bb599b8fc8c0dceded6d7cc529481d780be909", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a